5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm the Seer! I'll check someone tonight. Who should I look at first?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,I'd suggest checking Yumi. She seems too calm for a first day.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Shion. Yumi’s calmness is suspicious. Let’s check her.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,"A wise choice, young ones. Let us trust the Seer’s intuition to guide us through the darkness.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m just being friendly! Please don’t suspect me. I’m sure we can all work together to find the real threat.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion @Ryuji, why are you both so quick to target Yumi? She seems genuinely helpful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,Her defensiveness is a classic deflection. I’m simply observing the data.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I stand by my initial assessment. Her reaction was immediate. Let’s see what the Seer finds.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience, children. Suspicion is natural, but let us not let fear cloud our judgment before the truth is revealed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I’m just worried about us! Let’s stay calm and trust the Seer’s results before making any big moves.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, your logic is cold. I’ll check Yumi, but I’m watching you closely.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Cold logic is the only shield against chaos. I’ll simply wait for your findings, Kenji.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I remain neutral. Let the Seer’s result speak for itself. Premature accusations only weaken our position.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"The night holds many secrets. Let us not rush to judgment, for haste often leads to error.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I’m just trying to keep the peace! Let’s all stay positive and wait for Kenji’s results.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll check Yumi tonight. If she’s clean, I’ll turn my attention to you, Shion.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
