31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I checked Yumi and she is human! The werewolf is among the rest of you.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,Interesting. So the threat is closer than I thought. I’ll keep my eyes on everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
