39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A valid point, Ryuji. Yet Shion’s persistence is also a data point. We must weigh all evidence carefully before acting.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I’m just relieved to be cleared! But I agree with Ryuji—Shion’s behavior is really suspicious.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
